  (text "ESP32-S3\nGPIO1 (ADC1_CH0) ← CH1\nGPIO2 (ADC1_CH1) ← CH2\nGPIO3 (ADC1_CH2) ← CH3\nGPIO4 (ADC1_CH3) ← CH4\nGND → Signal GND\n3.3V → R_DIV top"
    (at 200.66 43.18 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
  )

  (text "NOTE: Repeat U1-RV1 block for CH2 (GPIO2), CH3 (GPIO3), CH4 (GPIO4)\nU3 (1.65V buffer) is SHARED across all 4 channels\nAll INA128 REF pins connect to U3 output (1.65V)\nSupply: 9V battery → LM7805 → 5V → U1,U2,U3 VCC\nUse separate analog GND plane; join to digital GND at single star point"
    (at 5.08 80.01 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
  )

  (text "PCA9685 SERVO DRIVER (shared)\nVCC=5V, GND, SDA→GPIO8, SCL→GPIO9\nCH0-CH4: SG90 fingers (0°-180°)\nCH5: MG996R wrist\nPWM freq: 50Hz"
    (at 5.08 100.33 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
  )

  (text "COMPONENT REFERENCE SUMMARY\nR_G: 1kΩ 1% MF (G=51 for INA128) × 4\nR_PROT: 10kΩ × 8 (input protection, 2 per channel)\nC_HPF: 470nF film × 8 (Sallen-Key HPF, 2 per channel)\nR_HPF1: 12kΩ × 4; R_HPF2: 24kΩ × 4 (fc=20Hz)\nR_N1,R_N2: 10kΩ 1% × 8; R_N_HALF: 5.1kΩ 1% × 4 (Twin-T)\nC_N1,C_N2: 330nF 1% × 8; C_N_DOUBLE: 680nF 1% × 4 (Twin-T)\nRV1: 100kΩ B100K pot × 4 (variable gain)\nR_AA: 1kΩ × 4 (ADC series protection)\nC_AA: 33nF × 4 (anti-alias cutoff ~145kHz)\nR_DIV1,R_DIV2: 10kΩ × 2 (REF = 1.65V divider)\nU1: INA128PA DIP-8 × 4; U2: MCP6002 DIP-8 × 4; U3: MCP6002 (REF buffer, shared)"
    (at 5.08 115.57 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
  )

)
